# Floating Bottom Bar — 5-tab react-navigation bar with a Skia "shader light" that springs under the active tab.
# What this test covers: every tab in order and in reverse; long jumps
# (first<->last) so the spring overshoots across several tabs; rapid taps on
# different tabs to retarget the spring mid-flight; re-tapping the active tab.
# Tabs are unlabeled icons, so they are tapped by position (centres at
# x 63/132/201/270/338, y 807).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/floating-bottom-bar"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 10000
wait 1000
press 132 807
wait 600
press 201 807
wait 600
press 270 807
wait 600
press 338 807
wait 600
press 270 807
wait 600
press 201 807
wait 600
press 132 807
wait 600
press 63 807
wait 600
# Long jumps.
press 338 807
wait 800
press 63 807
wait 800
# Retarget the spring mid-flight.
press 338 807
wait 80
press 132 807
wait 80
press 270 807
wait 80
press 63 807
wait 80
press 201 807
wait 1000
# Re-tap the active tab several times.
press 201 807 --count 4
wait 800
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\" id=\"xmark\""
wait 1500
